wolf3d @PROJECT_VERSION@ - shared engine library
=====================================================

This is the platform-neutral wolf3d-lib distribution. It contains the shared
engine, its public C99 header, the replaceable Nuked-OPL3 shared library, and
the applicable license and provenance files.

A host populates wolf3d_platform_api_t with video, input, timing, error, and
PCM callbacks, calls wolf3d_SetPlatform(), and then calls wolf3d_Create(),
wolf3d_Run(), and wolf3d_Shutdown(). See docs/porting-guide.md in the source
distribution and the companion wolf3d-portable repository for examples.

Windows distributions include wolf3d.lib, the import library for wolf3d.dll.
ELF distributions contain the versioned libwolf3d.so SONAME chain.

Official Windows packages embed the MSVC runtime and do not require the Visual
C++ Redistributable. Custom WG_STATIC_MSVC_RUNTIME=OFF builds require the
matching Redistributable.

Nuked-OPL3 is LGPL-2.1-or-later and remains a separate, replaceable shared
library. See COPYING.Nuked-OPL3.txt and THIRD_PARTY.md.
